# Git workflow

- Push **only** to `main`. Do not create or push feature branches unless the owner explicitly asks.
- When committing work, use **multiple small commits** with clear messages — never squash a large change into one commit.
- Do not merge via PR unless asked; land work on `main` and `git push origin main`.
